Dear Nirvana Pilots,
we are happy to bring you this update with some popular demand changes to improve scene readability in races!

Changes:

 Obstacles are made more visible by coloring their front;
 Baseline noise/glitching disabled;
 Losing Nirvana Sync during races won't trigger cosmetic effects (noise/glitching) anymore;
 The ultraship has now a toon style outline.


Enjoy, and don't forget to leave a honest review here on Steam!

Hello Nirvana Pilots,
we just released a major update!

v1.2 Changes:

 improvement: Nirvana Sync in races has now an ahestetic effect only. When you lose Nirvana Sync the ultraship won't go faster and faster (we felt it was too punitive), but some glitches will appear on the screen;
 improvement: now brakes work differently and allow you to slow down from the maximum ultra-speed (300) to a minimum ultra-speed of 200;
 improvement: you can activate the Retro TV filter for the races in Settings/Graphic Settings;
 improvement: new input system to support more joypads;
 improvement: 60fps framerate lock;
 improvement: removed the flash at engines activation, which was causing stuttering;
 improvement: ESC pauses the races;
 bugfix: P didn't pause the game, now it does.


Keep racing and let us know if you liked the improvements!

